1
00:00:00,858 --> 00:00:04,108
(Penny:)...I dreamed of moving to L.A.
and becoming a movie star.

2
00:00:04,278 --> 00:00:07,658
(Penny:)Anyway, after four years
of acting lessons and waiting tables...

3
00:00:07,823 --> 00:00:09,703
...I've done a hemorrhoid
commercial...

4
00:00:09,867 --> 00:00:12,537
(Penny:)...and a production of Anne Frank
above a bowling alley.

5
00:00:13,829 --> 00:00:16,499
(Penny:)So you know, dreams do come true.

6
00:00:17,791 --> 00:00:20,421
(Penny:)- Your turn.
- Uh, let's see. Ahem. Uh...

7
00:00:20,586 --> 00:00:23,256
(Leonard:)I am an experimental physicist
at CaItech.

8
00:00:23,422 --> 00:00:26,632
(Leonard:)Most of my research
is with high-powered lasers, and...

9
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,050
Oh, l've just gotten
a big government grant...

10
00:00:29,219 --> 00:00:32,969
(Leonard:)...to see if they can be used
to knock out incoming ballistic missiles.

11
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:35,270
- Wow. Can they?
- Oh, God, no.

12
00:00:39,271 --> 00:00:40,691
But the money's pretty good.

13
00:00:42,274 --> 00:00:45,524
(Leonard:)And I used the equipment
to make my own Bat-Signal.

14
00:00:46,904 --> 00:00:49,364
(Penny:)Bat-Signal?
What are you, some kind of nerd?

15
00:00:50,073 --> 00:00:57,023
(Leonard:)Not some kind of nerd,
I am the king of nerds.

